%% BGP Graceful Restart
sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Restarting router
    participant H as Helper (neighbor)
    R->>H: OPEN with Graceful Restart capability
    H->>R: OPEN with Graceful Restart capability
    Note over R,H: Session Established
    R--xH: Session drops (bgpd restart)
    Note over H: Marks routes as stale<br/>keeps them in FIB
    R->>H: New session, OPEN with R-bit
    H->>R: Resends routes
    R->>H: End-of-RIB
    Note over H: Removes stale routes<br/>that were not re-advertised
